								if not taggedCrops[crop] then
									if GrowthTrackerMode == "FRUIT ALL" or GrowthTrackerMode == "FRUIT SPEC" then
										processCropForFruitTracking(crop, GrowthTrackerMode, GrowthSpecificName, taggedCrops)
									elseif GrowthTrackerMode == "PLANT ALL" or GrowthTrackerMode == "PLANT SPEC" then
										processCropForPlantTracking(crop, GrowthSpecificName, taggedCrops)
									end
								end
							end
						end
					end
				end
				-- Remove only tracker visuals that are no longer tracked.
				for _, plot in ipairs(allPlots) do
